WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.535
-Thanks to newly developed
technology,

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:05.104
we here at "Late Night" now have
the ability to record

00:00:05.104 --> 00:00:09.041
the tiny voice that is
inside Donald Trump's head.

00:00:09.041 --> 00:00:10.543
And you might be surprised
to know that,

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:12.978
like everyone's inner voice --
and we all have them --

00:00:12.978 --> 00:00:16.849
Donald Trump's is filled with
paralyzing fear and self-doubt.

00:00:16.849 --> 00:00:18.952
So here it is, the tiny voice

00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:21.187
in the back
of Donald Trump's head.

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:24.557 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:27.493 --> 00:00:30.830
-Hey, Donald. It's the tiny
voice in the back of your head.

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:33.533
And I'm letting you know that
your greatest fear is true --

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:35.668
no one likes or respects you.

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:37.637
The two world leaders
you're standing between

00:00:37.637 --> 00:00:40.006
are embarrassed to be on stage
with you right now.

00:00:40.006 --> 00:00:41.540
As soon as this is over,

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:43.709
they're going to go to dinner
and talk about you.

00:00:43.709 --> 00:00:45.645
They're going to talk
about how weird it is

00:00:45.645 --> 00:00:48.014
that a 70-year-old man
can't stand still

00:00:48.014 --> 00:00:50.016
and always has to
swing his body around

00:00:50.016 --> 00:00:51.784
like a first-grader
who has to pee.

00:00:51.784 --> 00:00:53.853
And then they'll probably
talk about a bunch of stuff

00:00:53.853 --> 00:00:55.954
you don't understand,
like politics

00:00:55.954 --> 00:00:57.757
and countries and sanity.

00:00:57.757 --> 00:01:00.026
And they're not going to
invite you to dinner.

00:01:00.026 --> 00:01:02.028
You know what you're
going to do for dinner?

00:01:02.028 --> 00:01:03.996
You're going to eat
a cheeseburger in bed.

00:01:03.996 --> 00:01:05.364
Sad!

00:01:05.364 --> 00:01:07.166
-In my capacity as...

00:01:07.166 --> 00:01:08.400
-Hey, Donald.

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:10.636
It's me, the tiny voice
in the back of your head.

00:01:10.636 --> 00:01:12.072
Are you thinking
what I'm thinking?

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:14.274
Because I'm thinking
that Mike Pence

00:01:14.274 --> 00:01:17.109
looks a lot more
like a president than you do.

00:01:17.109 --> 00:01:18.778
I mean, look at him.

00:01:18.778 --> 00:01:23.082
He's killing it right now,
speaking in complete sentences,

00:01:23.082 --> 00:01:26.452
turning the page
each time he finishes a page,

00:01:26.452 --> 00:01:28.087
not making insane gestures.

00:01:28.087 --> 00:01:30.290
He looks like a real president.

00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:31.323
And look at you.

00:01:31.323 --> 00:01:32.992
You look like a guy
who won a contest

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:35.261
to stand next to a president.

00:01:35.261 --> 00:01:37.363
I mean,
he's a complete freak and all,

00:01:37.363 --> 00:01:40.066
but at least he can
fake being normal.

00:01:40.066 --> 00:01:44.002
How does it feel
to be weirder than Mike Pence?

00:01:44.002 --> 00:01:45.204
-Kind Father in heaven --

00:01:45.204 --> 00:01:46.372
-Hey, Donald.

00:01:46.372 --> 00:01:48.040
It's the tiny voice
in the back of your head,

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:50.242
and I'm going to say the prayer
you wish you could say

00:01:50.242 --> 00:01:51.611
right now.

00:01:51.611 --> 00:01:54.380
Dear Lord, please let me handle
this elaborate charade

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:55.581
that I'm trapped in.

00:01:55.581 --> 00:01:57.750
Please let me open my eyes
and be transported

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:00.253
back to when I was running
casinos and making cameos

00:02:00.253 --> 00:02:01.521
in "Home Alone,"

00:02:01.521 --> 00:02:04.523
back to a time when I was
disliked but still sort of

00:02:04.523 --> 00:02:06.425
a beloved kind of a freak.

00:02:06.425 --> 00:02:08.928
But if that can't happen, Lord,
can you please at least

00:02:08.928 --> 00:02:11.664
transform this glass of water
in front of me into

00:02:11.664 --> 00:02:15.134
a 30-liter bottle of Diet Coke
and a bucket of chicken nuggets?

00:02:15.134 --> 00:02:18.938
Because, honestly, Lord, that is
all I really want right now.

00:02:18.938 --> 00:02:21.473
Please, Lord,
make everyone disappear

00:02:21.473 --> 00:02:23.610
and put chicken nuggets
in front of me.

00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:25.344
I'm going to open my eyes, Lord.

00:02:25.344 --> 00:02:28.514
I'm going to open my eyes,
and please let that be the case.

00:02:28.514 --> 00:02:30.316
Oh, God damn it.

00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:32.318 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:34.053 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:34.053 --> 00:02:36.256
-It's an amazing --
It's an amazing technology.

